{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21671","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:27.297636+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"`pmap` with `out_axes=None` can silently give incorrect numbers\r\n\r\n```python\r\nx = jax.pmap(lambda x: x, in_axes=0, out_axes=None)(jnp.arange(3))\r\nprint(x)  # 0\r\n\r\ny = jax.pmap(lambda _, x: jax.lax.psum(x, 'i'), axis_name='i', in_axes=(0, None), out_axes=None)(jnp.zeros(3), x)\r\nprint(y)  # 3\r\n```\r\n\r\nPeople probably shouldn't use pmap with out_axes=None, though I suspect they do! Better to use shard_map, especially once we simplify its API...","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21671/comments","created_at":"2024-06-05T16:25:21Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/21671/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/21671","id":2336345986,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"2A9ECB","default":false,"description":"This ought to be addressed, but has no schedule at the moment. (Assignee optional)","id":2995429402,"name":"P2 (eventual)","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTk1NDI5NDAy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/P2%20(eventual)"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"F73EB3","default":false,"description":"","id":8084153681,"name":"skill issue","node_id":"LA_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAAB4dplUQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/skill%20issue"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/